### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Reyes",
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "blue",
  "birthday": "1995-05-20"
}

### Put contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Reyes",
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "green",
  "birthday": "1995-05-20"
}

### Delete contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE